        "Content": "•\tDetached family residence in an exclusive gated development \r\n\r\n•\tSpacious and versatile four-bedroom layout extending to two levels \r\n\r\n•\tGround-floor bedroom with en-suite, ideal for multi-generational living \r\n\r\n•\tPrincipal suite with dressing room and en-suite bathroom \r\n\r\n•       BER B\r\n\r\n•       157 m² / 1690 ft²\r\n\r\n•\tTwo designated underground parking spaces conveniently located close to the front door \r\n\r\n•\tPrivate rear garden with low-maintenance landscaping \r\n\r\n•\tBeautifully maintained communal grounds with mature trees and established planting \r\n\r\n•\tPrime Clontarf location within walking distance of the DART, St Anne's Park, coastal amenities and local shopping facilities"
